        <obo:IAO_0000115>One of three fluid-filled semicircular tubes, arranged orthogonally to each other in each ear.  The posterior semicircular canal is associated with the posterior crista. (See Anatomical Atlas entry for &lt;a href=&apos;http://zfin.org/zf_info/anatomy/dict/semi_canal/semi.html&apos;&gt;semicircular canals&lt;/a&gt; by T. Whitfield.)</obo:IAO_0000115>
