        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Octaval sensory nucleus located rostral to the magnocellular octaval nucleus and arches dorsally around the descending trigeminal root. Receives some vestibular information and is part of the vestibulo-ocular reflex circuitry and projects to abducens and oculomotor nuclei and descends to the spinal cord. From Neuroanatomy of the Zebrafish Brain.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0000274</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>anterior octaval nucleus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>nucleus octavus anterior</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>zebrafish_anatomy</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ZFA:0000274</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>rostral octaval nucleus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
