        <obo:IAO_0000115>Extraocular muscle that runs parallel to the long axis of the fish and inserts on the anterior side of the eye at the sclera-corneal (SC) junction.  The medial rectus lies in the same anatomical plane as the lateral rectus.  The medial rectus is innervated by the oculomotor nerve.</obo:IAO_0000115>
