        <obo:IAO_0000115>Tegmental nucleus that is immediately adjacent to the nucleus lateralis valvulae (NLV).  This nucleus is sometimes considered part of the NLV but the cells are more densely packed.  The nucleus extends rostrally into the mesencephalon.</obo:IAO_0000115>
