        <obo:IAO_0000115>Ventral, superficial, paired muscle that originates from the posterior part of the protractor ishii tendon and the midline.  At the midline the paired muscles contact each other.  These are short muscles that attach to all pelvic fin rays except ray 1 and ray 2.</obo:IAO_0000115>
