            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Continuation of the caudal vein cranial to the anal pore. The cardinal vein splits into a pair of vessels in the cranial trunk, just caudal to the radix of the aorta. The posterior cardinals each empty into the common cardinal vein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0000477</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>PCV</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
