        <obo:IAO_0000115>Small thin adductor muscle that is part of the pectoral fin. The origin of the adductor profundus lies along the developing anterior skeletal flange of the pectoral girdle.  The adductor profundus develops from the primitive pectoral fin adductor.</obo:IAO_0000115>
