        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Patch of thickened, pseudostratified epithelium that is associated with the anterior semicircular canal. It consists of regular arrays of sensory hair cells interspersed with supporting cells. The anterior crista has its own characteristic shape and polarity pattern. (See Anatomical Atlas entry for &lt;a href=&apos;http://zfin.org/zf_info/anatomy/dict/sens/sens.html&apos;&gt;sensory patches of the ear&lt;/a&gt; by T. Whitfield.)</obo:IAO_0000115>
