        <obo:IAO_0000115>Lower layer of the epidermis. Composed of a single layer of cells.  The major function of the basal stratum is to keep the epidermis attached to the underlying dermis by means of (hemidesmosomes attached to the basement membrane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0001180</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>basal epidermal layer</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
