        <owl:annotatedTarget>Multi-tissue structure that attach the zonules, that suspend the lens, to the eye.  The ciliary zone secretes aqueous humor.  Unlike mammals zebrafish the ciliary zone dose not contain processes or a circumferential band of muscle.</owl:annotatedTarget>
