        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Vein that branches off the nasal ciliary artery.  Initially, at 2dpf, the dorsal ciliary vein (DCV) drains into the primordial midbrain channel (PMBC) or the PMBC/PHBC junction.  Later, by 3.5dpf,  the DCV drains into the optic choroid vascular plexus.  The dorsal branch of the inner optic circle drains into the DCV.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0005030</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>DCV</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
