        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An interneuron in the spinal cord.  CoPA are bipolar with &quot;T&quot; shaped dorsal dendrites, have contralateral longitudinal axons that crosses the cord dorsal to the Mauthner neuron and ascends in the dorsal cord. These neurons are glutamatergic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>Ceri</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2009-06-18T01:41:54Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
