        <obo:IAO_0000115>An interneuron of the spinal cord. CoSA,  have contralateral longitudinal axons that crosses the cord dorsal to the Mauthner neuron and ascends in the dorsal cord.  These neurons are glutamatergic and glycinergic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
