        <obo:IAO_0000115>Anterior portion of the ventral region of the glomerular layer of the olfactory bulb. In the ventroanterior zone there are  typically seven small glomeruli located 11-20 micrometers beneath the superficial axon bundles  The ganglion differed conspicuously in sizes, shapes, and distribution, and were not individually  identifiable.</obo:IAO_0000115>
