        <obo:IAO_0000115>A system of osteocytes connected through canals within the vertebra.  Osteocytes extend processes through canals within ossified bone.  The lacunocanalicular system is poorly developed in zebrafish with most  osteocytes having one or two cytoplasmic processes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
