            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Portion of the intestinal rod that loops to left between 26-30hpf and gives rise to the intestinal bulb and liver and anterior pancreatic primordium.  The endoderm at this stage is a compact mass of cells with little to no polarization.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>Ceri</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2013-07-23T03:06:11Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
