        <owl:annotatedTarget>Portion of the intestinal rod that loops to left between 26-30hpf and gives rise to the intestinal bulb and liver and anterior pancreatic primordium.  The endoderm at this stage is a compact mass of cells with little to no polarization.</owl:annotatedTarget>
