            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cuboidal epithelial cell that is continuous with the lining of intercalated ducts that drain the acinus. This cell type secretes a high pH solution to aid in activation of zymogens, and can differentiate into endocrine and exocrine pancreatic cell types.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>Ceri</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2013-07-29T10:16:32Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
