        <obo:IAO_0000115>Transient cluster of cardiac progenitor cells that develops adjacent to the heart and migrates onto the heart to form the epicardium.  Proepicardial clusters in Zebrafish form on the pericardial wall, adjacent to the atrioventricular (AV) junction and near the venous pole.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>Ceri</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2014-07-28T03:01:42Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
