        <oboInOwl:id>ZFA:0005836</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Although a facial lymphatic vessel has previously been described using lymphangiography in 5-week-old zebrafish (Yaniv et al., 2006), we are not sure whether
this previously described vessel is connected to, or derived from, the FL network that we have identified (ZDB-PUB-120529-43).</rdfs:comment>
