        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pair of lymph vessel that follows the right subintestinal vein. At  6 dpf, the LR-IL appears to bifurcate and form two separate vessels that both run in close proximity to one another along the right sub intestinal vein. These vessels are difficult to distinguish from each other at 6dp.</obo:IAO_0000115>
