        <owl:annotatedTarget>Commissure that is formed by a subset of TCPT axons that cross the midline in the diencephalon.  The TCPTc does not appear to cross with other commissures.  The initial crossing of the TCPTc occurs at approximately 36 hpf.</owl:annotatedTarget>
