        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Transient plexus formed by vasculogenesis that results in the formation of an intermediate network of similar sized vessels with polygonal-shaped avascular spaces.  As the vasculature matures it is remodeled into a hierarchical vascular tree.</obo:IAO_0000115>
