        <obo:IAO_0000115>Non stereotyped venous plexus derived from specialised angioblast that originate in the floor of the posterior cardinal vein.  Emerges from the duct of Cuvier at 2dpf as a reticular structure that spreads bilaterally over the surface of the yolk and gut.</obo:IAO_0000115>
