        <obo:IAO_0000115>Large pear-shaped dopaminergic neuron that ascend from the ventral diencephalon group DC2 to the telencephalon. These neurons may be the correlate of mammalian substantia nigra (SNc) neurons.  DC2 neurons are located rostrally and their processes project laterally.</obo:IAO_0000115>
