        <obo:IAO_0000115>Large pear-shaped dopaminergic neuron that ascend from the posterior tuberculum to the subpallium. These neurons may be the correlate of mammalian substantia nigra (SNc) neurons. DC4 neurons are located caudally and their processes projected dorsolaterally.</obo:IAO_0000115>
