        <obo:IAO_0000115>Blood vessel that emerges from the maxilla, wraps around the sinus isthmus, then runs alongside the distal bulb to enter the barbel shaft proper. There are two ventral vessels that connect distally in the maxillary barbel forming a complete capillary loop.</obo:IAO_0000115>
