        <obo:IAO_0000115>Premigratory neural crest population that develops from the neural plate border. The cells of this group will undergo epithelial to mesenchymal transition and delaminate to produce the migratory neural crest.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>yvonne</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2016-01-28T09:06:50Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
