        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mature osteoblast that has become embedded in the bone matrix. They occupy a small cavity, called lacuna, in the matrix and are connected to adjacent osteocytes via protoplasmic projections called canaliculi.</obo:IAO_0000115>
