        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell capable of processing and presenting lipid and protein antigens to T cells in order to initiate an immune response.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CL:0000145</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0009088</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
