        <obo:IAO_0000115>An acidophilic cell of the anterior pituitary that produces growth hormone, somatotropin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CL:0000295</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>TAO:0009155</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
