        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pigment cell derived from the neural crest. The cell contains flat light-reflecting platelets, probably of guanine, in stacks called reflecting platets or iridisomes. The color-generating components produce a silver, gold, or iridescent color.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>ZFA:0001090</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CL:0000431</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
