        <owl:annotatedTarget>A pigment cell derived from the neural crest. The cell contains flat light-reflecting platelets, probably of guanine, in stacks called reflecting platets or iridisomes. The color-generating components produce a silver, gold, or iridescent color.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CL:curator</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


